 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nThamesview Logistics Ltd                                  MASTER SERVICES\n14 King Street, M1 2AB Manchester, United Kingdom        AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB322051317\n\nFROM                                                             BILL TO\n\nThamesview Logistics Ltd                                        Westbrook Pharma Ltd\n14 King Street                                                  221 Baker Street\nM1 2AB Manchester                                               BS1 5TR Bristol\nUnited Kingdom                                                  United Kingdom\nVAT: GB322051317\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 16/04/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Thamesview\nLogistics Ltd, with its registered office at 14 King Street, Manchester (\"Party A\"), and Westbrook Pharma Ltd, with its registered office at\n221 Baker Street, Bristol (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Thamesview Logistics Ltd / Oliver Bennett\nParty B    Westbrook Pharma Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nDate       16/04/2026",
